  "description": "Golden eval cases for DetectGearInImage. Each case points at a real product photo under server/test_data/ and asserts that the AI recovers title / brand / model / material / weight / value from the image. Opt-in per field: fields omitted from 'expected' are not checked. Tolerances on numeric fields are wide because image-based weight and value estimation is inherently imprecise.",
